  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cf75ba197a804abe5a0c056f476477570ead71a1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2040\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">用装饰链连接你的栅栏与围墙！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"151\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" width=\"151\" height=\"50\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/415681?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&color=f16436\" alt=\"\" width=\"175\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconnectiblechains\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ykSfIgTw?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/legoatoom/ConnectibleChains\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/legoatoom/ConnectibleChains/total?logo=GitHub&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2>简介</h2>\n<p>使用装饰链连接你的栅栏或围墙！</p>\n<p>在栅栏或围墙上直接使用原版铁链物品即可。</p>\n<p>这些链条具有碰撞体积，可以使用剪刀进行破坏。<br>若需正常放置，请站在栅栏上方潜行。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">已停止维护</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">历经五年的更新后，我决定停止维护此模组。我已不再热衷于开发它，且如今很少游玩《我的世界》，因此将不再更新 Connectible Chains。源代码保持开源，任何人均可 Fork 并继续开发。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span>持续维护</span> <span>的</span> <span>Fork：</span> <a href=\"https://github.com/evanbones/Reconnectible-Chains\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">evanbones/Reconnectible-Chains</a>&nbsp;<span>——</span> <span>该</span> <span>Fork</span> <span>为</span> <span>独立</span> <span>维护</span> <span>，</span> <span>与</span> <span>原</span> <span>项</span> <span>目</span> <span>无</span> <span>隶</span> <span>属</span> <span>关</span> <span>系</span> <span>亦</span> <span>未</span> <span>获</span> <span>其</span> <span>认</span> <span>可</span>。</span></p>\n<h3>问题反馈</h3>\n<p>如果您遇到任何 Bug 或有反馈建议，<strong>请勿在此处发布</strong>，请直接前往 GitHub <a href=\"https://github.com/legoatoom/ConnectibleChains/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issue 页面</a> 提交。</p>\n<h3>版本支持</h3>\n<p>我将不再支持 1.21.11 以下的版本。</p>\n<h3>与其他模组的兼容性</h3>\n<p>请参阅 Wiki，了解如何仅通过数据包和资源包自行添加对其他模组的支持。</p>\n<h3>Forge 版本？</h3>\n<ol><li>已有 Forge 移植版，但<strong>我不再维护它。</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectible-chains-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectible-chains-forge</a></li></ol>\n<p>2. Sinytra Connector 可能也能兼容运行。</p>\n<h3>其他信息</h3>\n<p>如果因某些原因出现隐形碰撞体，请在开启实体碰撞箱（F3+B）的情况下手持剪刀查看，然后攻击以移除它们。</p>",
